### Dataset Structure

The dataset follows a standard directory structure:
```
chest_xray/
├── train/
│   ├── normal/
│   └── pneumonia/
├── val/
│   ├── normal/
│   └── pneumonia/
└── test/
    ├── normal/
    └── pneumonia/
```

### Dataset Splitting Strategy

**Training Set**: Used for model training with data augmentation  
**Validation Set**: Used for hyperparameter tuning and model selection  
**Test Set**: Used for final model evaluation (held-out data)  

This ensures unbiased evaluation and prevents overfitting to the test data.# Configuration parameters
